 max-w-[var(--cds-message-bubble-measure)] bg-[var(--cds-bg-user-message)]" style="max-width: 638px;"><div id="_r_3_" class=""><div class="cds-user-message-body"><div data-testid="user-message" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 relative [&amp;_ul]:!space-y-0 [&amp;_ol]:!space-y-0 [&amp;_ul]:ps-8 [&amp;_ol]:ps-8 [--msg-block-radius:initial]"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words" dir="rtl">دارم صفحه‌ی جدید با رنگ و آیکون‌های حرفه‌ای تعمیرات موبایل و QR با اسم مغازه وسطش رو می‌سازم و تست می‌کنم.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-cds="MessageActions" data-reveal="fade" role="toolbar" aria-label="Message actions" data-size="xs" tabindex="-1" class="flex items-center select-none [&amp;_button]:text-muted [&amp;_button:hover:not([aria-pressed=true])]:text-primary" data-testid="user-message-actions"><time data-cds="RelativeTime" datetime="2026-10-20T08:40:20.894Z" class="flex h-control items-center ps-sm pe-sm first:ps-0 last:pe-0 text-caption font-normal text-muted select-none" id="_r_4d_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="">23 hours ago</time><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor]" aria-label="Copy" 