time="2026-10-20T11:21:00.130Z" class="flex h-control items-center ps-sm pe-sm first:ps-0 last:pe-0 text-caption font-normal text-muted select-none" data-cds-tooltip-pending="">21 hours ago</time><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor]" aria-label="Copy" data-testid="user-message-copy" data-cds-tooltip-pending="" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-ghost-hover stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-ghost-hover "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size: calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1)); font-weight: 533.3;" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></div></div><span role="status" class="sr-only" data-find-omitted="" data-testid="failed-send-status-region"></span><div class="max-w-[85%]"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-test-render-count="2"><div class="group group/message-row"><div class="contents"><div data-testid="assistant-message" data-is-streaming="false" class="group relative relative pb-[var(--msg-assistant-pb,0.75rem)]"><h2 data-find-omitted="" class="sr-only select-none">Claude responded: بله، قدیمی رو کنار بذار و برو سراغ بعدی.</h2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:ps-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pe-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:ps-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pe-8 [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:ps-[var(--msg-block-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:pe-[var(--msg-inset-end,0.5rem)]"><div data-cds="Prose" class="prose" style="--_prose-font-body: var(--font-claude-response, var(--cds-font-voice)); --_prose-font-heading-display: var(--_prose-font-heading);"><div data-perf-reply-text="" class="_blocks_4za3l_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 whitespace-normal break-words print:block standard-markdown"><p dir="rtl">بله، قدیمی رو کنار بذار و برو سراغ بعدی. <code dir="ltr">qr.png</code> توی ریپازیتوری می‌تونه بمونه و ضرری نداره. فقط از QR جدیدی که از صفحه‌ی آنلاین گرفتی استفاده کن.</p>
<p dir="rtl">قبل از چاپ، یک بار QR جدید رو با گوشی خودت و یک گوشی دیگه اسکن کن و ببین همین سایت باز میشه. اگه فقط یک نسخه‌ی کوچیک اسکرین‌شات داری و برای چاپ بزرگ می‌خوای، بگو تا QR با کیفیت بالا بسازم.</p>
<p dir="rtl">حالا چی بعدیه؟ مثلاً عکس‌های قبل و بعد تعمیر، نظرات واقعی مشتری‌ها یا تغییر تخفیف‌ها.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-cds="MessageActions" data-reveal="fade" role="toolbar" aria-label="Message actions" data-size="xs" tabindex="-1" class="flex items-center select-none [&amp;_button]:text-muted [&amp;_button:hover:not([aria-pressed=true])]:text-primary ms-[calc(var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)_-_0.375rem)] -mt-1" data-testid="message-actions"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor]" aria-label="Copy" data-testid="action-bar-copy" data-cds-tooltip-pending="" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-